1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:03,958
The house was quiet when I came home.

2
00:00:04,558 --> 00:00:07,713
Then I saw the door. It was open.

3
00:00:08,313 --> 00:00:11,437
Who did this? Who dared to come in here?

4
00:00:12,037 --> 00:00:16,957
And then I found the letter… and I understood. She was gone.
